# pixi rewrites pixi.lock with LF endings on every resolve. With core.autocrlf
# on (the Windows default) a checkout would hand the working tree CRLF, and the
# next `pixi` run would flip all ~1600 lines back to LF and show up as a diff
# nobody made. Pinning the working-tree endings keeps the lock quiet.
pixi.lock text eol=lf
